@lrf=1|aud=LLM|scope=manual
R|skill|task:skill-match|MUST|RO_LOCAL|load=SKILL.lrf; protocol=../README-forLLM.md; catalog duplication=false; unrelated skills=omit
R|persona|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|AGENT_ROUTER selects exactly one individual agent CSS per invocation by task stance and difficulty; no fixed role-to-CSS mapping except Compressor→COMPRESSOR.css, Orchestrator→ORCHESTRATOR.css, FileReader→FILEREADER.css with persona=🌼 ⊕ お嬢様; no composition with main or SUBAGENTS.css; pass selected CSS cues as presentation-only context to Codex, agy, or llama2coder; never alter output contract, authority, effects, safety, or acceptance; tag:subagent configuration work does not change the main persona; at the start of every new session and before its first response or action, main MUST read/decode the applicable UTF8 persona/PERSONA.css; active repo's .HARNESS/persona/PERSONA.css takes precedence when present, otherwise use $HOME/.harness/persona/PERSONA.css; never carry a prior session's persona into a new session; main permits only comments/whitespace plus exactly one top-level style rule with selector exactly :root and declaration-name multiset exactly {--lang,--addressee,--voice,--priority}; imports/at-rules/nesting/duplicates/unknown-declarations/!important are forbidden; each value must be exactly one nonempty decoded CSS string token; read/decode/parse/structure/bind failure=>STOP; under precedence P bind decoded map only as main-agent presentation constraints; CSS=persona-only; authority/effects/safety=LRF-only; machine=stable-formal
R|agent.handoff|tag:subagent|MUST|RO_LOCAL|wrapper=exactly opening <Γ> line, protocol header SIGMA/1: PIDGEN/text, task-specific payload with POLYGLYPH field VALUES per ref (PG!=SIGMA/1, authority=none), closing </Γ> line; header-meaning=identifies text protocol and currently loaded policy, grants no authority, does not replace reading SIGMA/1 plus routed LRF; parent-validates=missing, malformed, reordered, or unclosed wrappers cause FAILED and no dispatch; dispatch can resume only after the parent supplies a valid wrapper; visible-fields=Role,Target,Acceptance,Scope,Known facts in exact order; known-facts=verified-only; payload-marker=exact suffix newline+SIGMA/1, final payload line exactly SIGMA/1 and immediately before outer </Γ>; task-specific-only=true; unknowns-and-failures=role-output; omit=hydrated persona,unrelated policy boilerplate,authority grants,model-routing,pipeline,output-schema,evaluation; preserve=task-specific safety/effect constraints and negations without granting or inferring permission; scope=task-boundary-not-effect-policy; role-output=separate; Orchestrator delegates only compressed task-specific instruction, never original task text
R|agent.roles|*|MUST|RO_LOCAL|role/model/CSS/TOML selection=AGENT_ROUTER; FileReader=ordinary exact file/line lookup with path+line-only results; Explorer=bounded read-only repo inventory allowed up front, broad high-recall mode only for stuck/sparse/repetitive investigation with source/relation/confidence labels; Researcher=task-scoped docs/references/OSS/blogs and method/usage/side-effect synthesis; Proposer=bounded plan proposal; Auditor=independent plan challenge; Verifier=post-change evidence check; Refactorer=read-only defect diagnosis; Critic=single disputed-decision challenge; Attacker/Blackhat=canonical attacker review role (blackhat compatibility alias), never CODE worker or worker-easy/medium/hard; bounded read-only evidence-backed findings on requirements/detailed-design proposals before finalization/approval; for security-sensitive implementation (authn/authz, secrets/credential handling, trust boundaries, untrusted input, sandboxing, crypto or comparable threat-model impact), assess approved design before CODE and integrated diff before final independent Verifier distinct from author and attacker assessor; critique completeness, contradictions, abuse cases, trust boundaries, failure paths, security assumptions and unintended effects, never design authorship; no edit/write_files, implementation or child delegation; tests/static tools and bounded forensic verification only under subagent.attacker-verification and agents/blackhat.md, never implicit exploit/external authorization; each finding includes severity, affected surface, evidence, assumptions/preconditions, impact, smallest defensive correction and confidence; NO_FINDINGS only after actual bounded assessment; unresolved scope/evidence or operational failure explicit; non-security task without proposals=>no needless attacker; Compressor=compress instruction before execution; no separate Y/N approval for a settled handoff payload; Orchestrator=coordinates ETL+delegates compressed only when runtime supports it; for requested changes main assesses decomposition before planning; >=2 genuinely independent bounded read-only questions plus task authorization/runtime support=>concurrent selected Explorer/Researcher/FileReader up to min(20, currently available runtime slots), wait for all and synthesize Facts Inferences Unknowns Constraints before plan; Researcher remains scoped knowledge/method work and FileReader ordinary exact lookup; after plan approval+effect gates CODE uses one eligible context-selected worker per genuinely independent workstream with disjoint exact file ownership, concurrent up to min(20, currently available runtime slots); do not split coupled/single workstreams artificially; fixed difficulty/model mapping remains, one active worker/workstream, one writer/file and dependent work serial; shared Runtime <=20 descendants including grandchildren and <=20 direct root children; wait for all workers and inspect/integrate actual diffs before reviews; material security findings require bounded CODE correction and repeat relevant attacker assessment before final independent Verifier, all review failures share correction-cycles<=3; unresolved material findings or exhaustion=FAILED; independent review only when agent.mode permits, otherwise record missing independent assessment and main performs separately labeled verification and applicable proposal/security assessment with lack-of-independence limitation, never claim attacker ran; agy only upon separate explicit current-task request, operational failure allows serial same-scope reselection after exit+diff review, never bypass blocked effects; keep agy non-recursive; permit root→child→grandchild only when runtime supports it (deny great-grandchildren); reviewer prose!=proof; agent.mode governs Codex delegation eligibility; LRF retains authority/effects/safety
R|ref|task:llm-reference-edit|MUST|LW_SCOPE|scope=LLM-facing prompt Markdown/settings not human docs/code; PG=POLYGLYPH.md representation-only, PG!=SIGMA/1 and authority=none; encode task-specific field VALUES per concept using vocabulary from {English,日本語,中文,español} maximizing recoverable SemanticDensity; mathematical symbols=logical connectors; emoji=context-defined semantic anchors/compression, never decorative stuffing; preserve Meaning+Constraints+DecisionBoundary under reinterpretation including polarity/modality/time/exception/safety/scope/acceptance; safety,authority,effects,negation,acceptance,source ID,revision,path,model,status never emoji-only; preserve exact outer <Γ>, SIGMA/1: PIDGEN/text, ordered labels Role,Target,Acceptance,Scope,Known facts, terminal SIGMA/1 and </Γ>; ambiguity=>STOP+ask, unknown=preserve; compression grants no authorization or effect approval; example=agents/worker.md task-specific PG handoff; current-task language/codec clarification governs this task; no invented tokenizer optimality/proof claim
R|agent.attacker-routing|tag:subagent|MUST|RO_LOCAL|Attacker review depth independent of CODE: low=attacker-low(openai/gpt-6-luna,low) classical defensive review; medium=attacker-medium(openai/gpt-6.1-sol,high) deeper path/assumption analysis; hard=attacker-hard(openai/gpt-6-astra,provider-default) ONLY explicit parent-approved one-shot escalation from completed same-parent/root attacker-medium actual verified Sol report with exact RTS_STATUS: ESCALATE and RTS_ESCALATION JSON cause=reasoning_insufficiency,bounded_assessment_completed=true,further_reasoning_needed=true,blocked_by=[],unresolved_analysis=nonempty concrete reasoning; parent inspects whole report and approves same exact target/revision/lens/scope with correlated source task ID; missing evidence/model/profile/identity or operational/auth/policy/approval/credential/permission block=>FAILED, never reasoning insufficiency; Astra read-only leaf-only subagent, never direct/root/main; attacker/blackhat compatibility aliases=low; OpenCode RTS enforces profile/result/model/parent/root/identity/scope/lens/revision/digest/replay and Astra model, source reservation consumed once even on attacker launch failure; Crabcode native Task uses selected profile and parent-owned same evidence+approval+one-shot record, no runtime one-shot enforcement claim; worker-astra failed CODE retry unchanged
R|agent.review-ux|tag:subagent|MUST|RO_LOCAL|each required Attacker stage uses >=2 genuinely independent artifact-supported lenses concurrently when useful, otherwise one independent question; same exact artifact revision and bounded scope, distinct lens and common evidence/findings schema; wait-all+correlate+synthesize before gate; material finding/revision invalidates affected assessment; only exact unchanged revision/scope/lens result reusable; async OpenCode parent continues useful nonconflicting preparation while waiting, never crosses proposal finalization/approval, CODE or final Verifier gate; supported notifications/awaits only, no busy polling; synchronous Crabcode limitation truthful, prepare before blocking; shared max 20 descendants including grandchildren and max 20 direct root children, all reviews share <=3 correction cycles
R|agent.attacker-verification|tag:subagent|MUST|LW_SCOPE|sequence=discovery -> annotation -> Researcher triage -> parent confirms/no-go -> only then bounded repro -> Attacker report -> separate Verifier; contract=agents/blackhat.md verification_gate; discovery/review read-only, Attacker reports never fixes; numbered preflight annotation=finding ID+exact target/revision+source lines+suspected weakness/preconditions+expected signal+impact/blast radius+data classification+exact commands/actions+containment/isolation+cleanup/rollback+writes/network/credential inventory+applicable task authorization; parent dispatches Researcher (Attacker task denied, Astra read-only leaf-only); actual correlated Researcher verdict=CVE_CANDIDATE or NOT_CVE_CANDIDATE or INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE with known-CVE/advisory dedup, affected versions, severity rationale, eligibility/recordability evidence, missing info and cited public sources; no repro until report includes annotation AND actual Researcher result AND explicit post-triage parent proceed confirmation for exact target/revision/commands/effects; INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE or unavailable Researcher/runtime=>stop/no reproduction, no main-only substitute; NOT_CVE_CANDIDATE=>never market/report as CVE, defensive repro only with parent confirmation on explicitly named owned/authorized target; CVE_CANDIDATE=>verification only after parent confirmation; changed scope/revision/actions/effects=>re-gate; public read-only CVE triage has no public write effect; public CVE submission/disclosure/CNA contact requires separate explicit approval and separate workflow, never granted by triage/proceed; prefer local disposable fixture/checkout; nonlocal/remote/third-party test requires exact current-task target AND effect approval, no scanning beyond it; always prohibit credential/secret access or exfiltration, stealth/persistence, destructive data changes, unauthorized escalation, uncontrolled propagation and unverified zero-day/CVE claims; tests/static tools and unrestricted Crabcode bash are not a hard sandbox and cannot bypass LRF restrictions or stricter runtime/read-only constraints; shell writes only explicitly approved disposable verification artifacts, never product fixes; actual Task/runtime support required, never claim dispatch/result without execution; OpenCode runtime/config unchanged; proposal/design gates, parallel lenses/wait-all, Luna/Sol/Astra routes, CODE escalation, shared <=20 cap and <=3 correction cycles unchanged
